        "code": "Inputs:\n- Inflow (streamflow + rainfall directly on pool) = 15,000 m³ / day\n- Outflow (controlled release + water supply extraction) = 12,000 m³ / day\n- Measured reduction in Reservoir Storage (ΔS) = -500 m³ / day\n\nCalculation:\n-500 = 15,000 - 12,000 - E\n-500 = 3,000 - E\nE = 3,000 + 500\nE = 3,500 m³ / day",
